* CVSD encoder C — no LM13700
* Passive integrator (same C∥R as A); ±Iabc via CD4066-class switches
* and a 2N3904 current mirror.
*
* Pins: AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

.subckt cvsd_enc_c AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

Xcmp AUDIO Y VCC VEE CMP 0 LM311
Rpull CMP VDD 4.7k

Xlogic CMP CLK BIT NBIT NCOIN CVSD_LOGIC

R1 NCOIN SYL 51.1k
R2 SYL 0 2.55Meg
Csyl SYL 0 100n

Rvref VDD VA 100
Cvref VA 0 100u
Xoa SYL VA_EMIT VCC VEE BASE TL072
Qp NODE BASE VA_EMIT Q2N3906
Rset VA VA_EMIT 30.9k

* BIT=1: source Iabc into INT; BIT=0: mirror-sink Iabc from INT
.model SW4066 SW(Vt=2.5 Von=4.5 Voff=0.5 Ron=80 Roff=100Meg)
Ssrc NODE INT BIT 0 SW4066
Smirr NODE IABC NBIT 0 SW4066
Qm IABC IABC VEE Q2N3904
Qs INT IABC VEE Q2N3904
Rbleed NODE 0 10Meg

Cint INT 0 10n
Rint INT 0 100k
Xfoll INT Y VCC VEE Y TL072

.ends cvsd_enc_c
